[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_whex8")
titel = "Halflings"
description = "Halflings are a strange exception to almost every rule, occupying a place somewhere between tall-folk and wild-folk (though most scholars now classify them as wild-folk).

They are a civilized people who build farms and settlements much like humans and elves. However, they are small, overwhelmingly male, and share the goblin practice of keeping tall-folk as cattle.

Halflings are rarely involved in high politics, and only a handful of halfling nobles are known to exist. However, they maintain good relations with all manner of creatures, trading and negotiating with folk whom most others would consider hostile.

Within the Empire, halflings make up most of the male population. Their ancient tradition of keeping tall-folk as hu-cows and ponygirls predates the Empire’s acceptance of similar goblin practices by thousands of years.

They are far gentler with their cattle than goblins are, but ultimately still reduce them to livestock."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://bkxhc74auednr"
